     "body": "<p>Hmm in FieldSearchResultSQLImpl.java there is this bit:</p>\n\n<p>        if (terms.indexOf(\"'\") != -1) </p>\n{\n            throw new QueryParseException(\"Query cannot contain the ' character.\");\n        }\n\n<p>which suggests that using single quotes is a no-no.</p>",
