      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>As discussed yesterday in the committer meeting this should not be a problem since fedora switched to using PreparedStatements.<br/>\nPreparedStatement is used in FieldSearchResultSQLImpl.java but single quotes were escaped with a backslash instead of a second single quote, which lead to a invalid query.<br/>\nsource: <a href=\"http://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/static/sql-syntax-lexical.html#SQL-SYNTAX-CONSTANTS\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/static/sql-syntax-lexical.html#SQL-SYNTAX-CONSTANTS</a><br/>\nNote: although link goes to postgresql doc using a second single quote to escape single quotes is ANSI sql.</p>",
     "created": "24/Aug/12 3:06 PM",
